# Resources: Cook (File > Cook Resources, or the Cook build target) copies scenes, materials,
# audio and config here from Assets. Those copies are not committed - Assets has the
# originals. Compiled files ARE committed: .cmodel, .cfont, .spv, .bill, .sky and their .meta.
/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.cmodel
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.cmodel.meta
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.cfont
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.cfont.meta
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.spv
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.spv.meta
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.bill
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.bill.meta
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.sky
!/Project/Crucible Engine/Resources/**/*.sky.meta
